<title>USA: Burnham Pacific buys Los Angeles property.</title>
<headline>Burnham Pacific buys Los Angeles property.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Burnham Pacific Properties Inc and the California Urban Investment Partners said they acquired the Margarita Plaza in Los Angeles for $9,570,000.</p>
<p>It said the plaza is a neighborhood shopping center in one of the most densely populated areas of southern California.</p>
</text>
